1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
A giant that bullets cannot hurt,

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,470
and nobody has ever caught.

3
00:00:04,512 --> 00:00:05,910
What is it?

4
00:00:06,064 --> 00:00:08,710
Meet the Mapinguari.

5
00:00:08,853 --> 00:00:11,227
In stories from the Amazon rainforest

6
00:00:11,227 --> 00:00:12,107
in Brazil,

7
00:00:12,107 --> 00:00:13,013
it is a huge,

8
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:14,016
hairy beast,

9
00:00:14,016 --> 00:00:15,800
with a smell so bad you

10
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,190
smell it before you see it.

11
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:20,288
Bullets bounce off its skin.

12
00:00:20,288 --> 00:00:22,120
Some tellings give it one big

13
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:22,580
eye,

14
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,747
and a mouth down to its

15
00:00:23,747 --> 00:00:24,857
belly.

16
00:00:24,857 --> 00:00:27,110
Others say its feet point backwards.

17
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:29,587
Now here is the real mystery.

18
00:00:29,587 --> 00:00:32,914
South America really had giants.

19
00:00:32,914 --> 00:00:34,230
Ground sloths.

20
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:37,070
Megatherium was six metres long and

21
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:38,870
weighed about four tonnes.

22
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:41,429
Its cousin Mylodon had little bony

23
00:00:41,429 --> 00:00:42,992
plates inside its skin,

24
00:00:42,992 --> 00:00:43,830
like armour.

25
00:00:43,904 --> 00:00:46,720
They vanished about twelve thousand years

26
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:47,190
ago.

27
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,944
Could one have hidden in the

28
00:00:48,944 --> 00:00:49,830
rainforest?

29
00:00:49,872 --> 00:00:51,590
Find out next.

